 to Andrew to have to be  shouted over by the presenter as Andrew  was trying to present facts and the  presenter started saying you know this  is not a propaganda Channel  quite hard to hear a CNN presenter  saying that actually but with a straight  face  um and Andrew Roberts of course had to  point out that if the Americans were  going to start attacking her late  Majesty for the for the crimes of  slavery they should remember that it was  her very distant answers to George III  who signed the anti-slavery act in 1807  um many decades before America had a  civil war and had to kill 600 000 of  their own citizens in order to do away  with vile trade Britain did away with it  peacefully and then policed the high  seas for decades that enormous National  costs so I'm afraid as I say sorry to  return to where I started what we see in  the American some of the American as I  say responds to the death of the queen  has been just an alarming historical  ignorance but driven by an alarming  present-day animus and I think that  we've seen who our friends are in  America across the aisle but we've also  seen particularly American Media who's  some really vitriolic enemies of Britain  are well Douglas you are always well  Pokemon spectator TV thank you so much  [Music]

